OL,3,GNEWSAAir traffic control issue causes
OL,4,AUK flight disruption for second time
OL,5,Athis month
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights in Scotland, Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fand the north of England are being
OL,9,Fdisrupted due to a "technical issue"
OL,10,Fwith air traffic control - here are the
OL,11,Fairports affected
OL,13,FNational Air Traffic Services says the
OL,14,Fissue at the Prestwick centre in
OL,15,FAyrshire is "now fixed", and it's
OL,16,Fworking to "safely lift air traffic
OL,17,Fregulations as quickly as we can"
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
