OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAir traffic control issue causes
OL,4,AUK flight disruption for second time
OL,5,Athis month
OL,6,
OL,7,FNats says the glitch was a
OL,8,F"connectivity issue with part of our
OL,9,Fsystems network", and was "nothing to
OL,10,Fdo" with a software defect that led to
OL,11,Fthe cancellation of 2,000 flights
OL,12,Facross the UK earlier this month
OL,14,FEasyJet - one of the airlines affected
OL,15,Ftoday - says this "once again calls
OL,16,Finto questions the resilience of Nats'
OL,17,Fsystems"
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
