OL,3,GNEWSAAir traffic control issue causes
OL,4,AUK flight disruption for second time
OL,5,Athis month
OL,6,
OL,7,FLewis Fraser, from Inverness, is stuck
OL,8,Fon the runway at Glasgow Airport. "We
OL,9,Fboarded the flight as normal but were
OL,10,Fimmediately told we were delayed...
OL,11,FSome passengers have left the plane,"
OL,12,Fhe tells us
